        "Content": "Dixon Residential is delighted to present 52 Brabazon Links, a spacious and beautifully presented three-bedroom, three-bathroom home ideally located in the heart of Bettystown.\r\n\r\nUpon entering, you are welcomed by a bright and spacious hallway leading into a comfortable and inviting living room, perfectly suited to both relaxing and entertaining. To the rear of the property, the modern kitchen and dining area provides a stylish and practical space for everyday living, with direct access to a private balcony. A guest WC completes the first floor.\r\n\r\nThe second floor comprises three generously proportioned bedrooms, including a well-appointed primary bedroom with its own en-suite, along with a contemporary family bathroom.\r\n\r\nLocation is key at this address, with unmatched connectivity for commuters. Laytown Train Station is just a 5-minute drive away for frequent rail links to Dublin, while the M1 motorway is reachable within 10 minutes. The property also is ideally positioned close to a wide range of local amenities, shops, restaurants and recreational facilities. There are also a number of schools and educational facilities in the surrounding area, making this an attractive choice for families. With designated parking and a prime seaside setting, 52 Brabazon Links represents the very best of coastal living. \r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended.  \r\n\r\nOffering well-proportioned accommodation, modern living spaces and a desirable location, 52 Brabazon Links is an excellent choice for those seeking a comfortable home in Bettystown.  \r\n\r\nEarly viewing is strongly advised.\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost care and attention have been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases, some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors, or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have.***"
